> Ten unfiltered held-out cases

Rows are evenly spaced in source order without quality ranking. Columns are clean target,
noisy input at 0.35, denoiser, ordinary reconstruction, masked observation, MAE composite,
fitting-mean composite and denoiser composite. All panels use fixed 0–1 gray. Values are sigmoid
reconstructions, not sampled binary pixels; clean targets and labels are display/evaluation only.

